<title>USA: Investors up Grow Biz stake to 7.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Investors up Grow Biz stake to 7.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minneapolis investors Sheldon and Terry Fleck said Wednesday that they raised their stake in Grow Biz International Inc to 479,000 common shares, or 7.66 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Flecks said they bought 103,600 shares of the company's stock between Oct. 10 and Nov. 21 at prices ranging from $8.81 to $9.31 a share.</p>
</text>
